{"kind": "mod", "id": 2461, "name": "craftable containers", "slug": "craftable-containers", "teaser": "adds container progression through hideout crafts", "owner_name": "s3til", "downloads": 8802, "favourites": 14, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.s3til.pcont", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Hideout", "category_id": 6, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T07:05:47.000000Z", "created_at": "2025-11-23T09:15:55.000000Z", "published_at": "2025-11-23T09:14:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0.8", "latest_version": "1.2.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p>one of my favorite mods has always been Leaves’ Progressive Container</p>\n<p>that doesn’t work with 4.0, so i made my own without any coding experience. welcome s3til’s craftable containers. it’s the same concept, but with my own code and recipes using the WTT library</p>\n<hr />\n<p>features:</p>\n<p>-craft containers (wow)</p>\n<p>-fully customizable in db/CustomHideoutCrafts/[[Containername]].jsonc</p>\n<p>recipes are as follows by default (without listing specific items bc im lazy)</p>\n<ol>\n<li>waist bag -&gt; alpha @ lavatory 1</li>\n<li>alpha -&gt; beta @ workbench 2</li>\n<li>beta -&gt; epsi @ workbench 2</li>\n<li>epsi -&gt; theta @ intel 1</li>\n<li>theta -&gt; gamma @ medstation 3</li>\n<li>gamma -&gt; gamma+ @ workbench 3</li>\n</ol>\n<p>6b. get the kappa from collector</p>\n<ol start=\"7\">\n<li>kappa -&gt; kappa+ @ intel 3</li>\n</ol>\n<p>-trade in your starting container at Ragman 1 for a waist bag!</p>\n<p>config in config/barter.jsonc</p>\n<p>change “ContainerForTrade” string to the container your edition starts with (alpha, beta, gamma, unheard gamma) and Ragman will trade that starting container for a waistbag at LL1</p>\n<hr />\n<p>recommended mod pairings (aka also what i play with):</p>\n<p>SVM to change containers to be different (gamma and gamma eod, kappa and kappa desecrated, etc)</p>\n<p>profile modifier to give yourself a waistbag at the start</p>\n<p>profile modifier to give yourself The Collector at the start</p>\n<hr />\n<p>any problems and i guess lmk and ill try to fix it ive literally never coded anything before so this was all taken in chunks from WTT and SPT documentation</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "4.0.6", "content_length": 23934, "downloads": 1242, "published_at": "2025-11-23T09:17:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2461/craftable-containers/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": [{"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib", "status": "ok"}]}, {"version": "1.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "4.0.7", "content_length": 23942, "downloads": 163, "published_at": "2025-11-29T22:52:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2461/craftable-containers/1.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": [{"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib", "status": "ok"}]}, {"version": "1.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "4.0.7", "content_length": 26374, "downloads": 96, "published_at": "2025-11-30T07:58:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2461/craftable-containers/1.1.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": [{"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib", "status": "ok"}]}, {"version": "1.1.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.7", "content_length": 26376, "downloads": 847, "published_at": "2025-11-30T08:34:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2461/craftable-containers/1.1.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path":